5.2.1 Encryption Results 

The radio communication was tested for resistance to unauthorised commands using a third BBC micro:bit configured as an attacker on the same radio group as the vehicle and transmitter. Three attack scenarios were tested, each with 100 commands sent to the vehicle's receiver. Results are shown in Table X and Figure X. 

 

 

